{"id":1753381,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-21T11:47:37.269Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"https://www.mntnfilm.com/en/film/sulle-dentate-scintillanti-1910","id":1753381,"imdb_id":"tt1107897","origin_country":["IT"],"original_language":"it","original_title":"Sulle dentate scintillanti vette","overview":"In 1910, Arrigo Frusta and the operator Giovanni B. Vitrotti took the camera up to the 4000 meters high of the Mont Blanc chain to make three short mountaineering films for the Società Anonima Ambrosio. They were the first in Italy to realize documentaries in the high mountains. In this third film, a party of three mountaineers, including Arrigo Frusta make a mountaineering ascent around Dent du Geant. The purpose of the film is not to narrate a concrete ascent, but to show the beauty & spectacle of the high mountain landscapes and the the fascination of those who venture to conquer the high peaks. The other two films of the series are: 'Escursioni sulla catena del Monte Bianco' and 'Da Courmayeur al Colle del Gigante'","popularity":0,"poster_path":null,"production_companies":[{"id":15029,"logo_path":null,"name":"Società Anonima Ambrosio","origin_country":"IT"}],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"IT","name":"Italy"}],"release_date":"1910-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":10,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"No Language","iso_639_1":"xx","name":"No Language"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Sulle dentate scintillanti vette","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[{"iso_3166_1":"IT","title":"Sulle dentate scintillanti","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"IT","title":"Sulle dentate vette","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"DE","title":"Wolken und Gletscher","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"FR","title":"Nuages et glaciers","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"US","title":"Clouds and Ice Fields","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"GB","title":"Clou